<%= s_('MinimalAccessProvisioning|Hello %{name},') % { name: @recipient.name } %>

<%= n_(s_('MinimalAccessProvisioning|We\'re notifying you that %{user_count} user provisioned through LDAP or SAML/SCIM has been assigned the Minimal Access role because restricted access is on and no seats are available in your subscription.'), s_('MinimalAccessProvisioning|We\'re notifying you that %{user_count} users provisioned through LDAP or SAML/SCIM have been assigned the Minimal Access role because restricted access is on and no seats are available in your subscription.'), @user_count) % { user_count: @user_count } %> <%= s_('MinimalAccessProvisioning|This count reflects users affected on %{sync_date}. The current number may differ if users have since been upgraded or removed.') % { sync_date: @sync_date } %>

<%= s_('MinimalAccessProvisioning|To identify the affected users, go to your top-level group members page and sort the members table by User created in descending order. The most recent users will appear at the top of the list.') % { sync_date: @sync_date } %>

<%= s_('MinimalAccessProvisioning|Users with the Minimal Access role can only view limited group information without access to projects.') %>

<%= s_('MinimalAccessProvisioning|To grant more permissions to these users, you should first review your seat usage. Then either:') %>

- <%= s_('MinimalAccessProvisioning|Change the users\' role in the group or project.') %>
- <%= s_('MinimalAccessProvisioning|Purchase more seats.') %>

<%= s_('MinimalAccessProvisioning|If you have any questions or need help, contact GitLab support.') %>

<%= s_('MinimalAccessProvisioning|Thank you,') %>

<%= s_('MinimalAccessProvisioning|The GitLab Team') %>

